    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Our Kickstarter Project</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/14f73d03bea2732bd11fdecef9ccbc0e.avif?t=1745485784\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/181f2b5dac0fca3beed1869ad87b24ac.avif?t=1745485784\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/a12888ac35918a258ce214f4a904ae59.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/a12888ac35918a258ce214f4a904ae59.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/a12888ac35918a258ce214f4a904ae59.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seasonal Wonders</h2></strong><br>Litchi Town unfolds around a venerable Litchi Tree, its centuries-old branches casting stories into the vibrant dance of seasons. Each season paints the town with distinct scenes, infusing the air with the spirit of cherished festivals and stirring events. Beyond the nostalgic streets, a world of natural wonder beckons\u2014bamboo groves, maple and birch forests, and sun-kissed beaches\u2014all home to hundreds of unique species, inviting endless exploration and surprises.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/11ca5247d6372e7f636ffa8d0379f4aa.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/11ca5247d6372e7f636ffa8d0379f4aa.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/11ca5247d6372e7f636ffa8d0379f4aa.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farmer's Paradise</h2></strong><br>Embrace the fertile lands of Litchi Town, where over sixty diverse crops flourish with the changing seasons. Reap, trade, or gift the fruits of your labor, and delve into the vibrant marketplaces that offer everything from floral wonders to mysterious wild botanicals. Vines casually planted by your cottage climb eagerly, transforming your home into a vivid mosaic of greenery and blossom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/8aed29131e21a49e144b40f7c49d1827.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/8aed29131e21a49e144b40f7c49d1827.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/8aed29131e21a49e144b40f7c49d1827.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customized Farming</h2></strong><br>Start by clearing land, planting crops, and tending livestock to build a farm that reflects your personal style. Decorate your cozy cabin with DIY furniture that combines rustic charm with botanical beauty. Dress in the town's finery and adorn your surroundings to reflect your style, making every corner of your domain a story of personal expression.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/d5a594d7a66f9ae08e2d10373be1efa4.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/d5a594d7a66f9ae08e2d10373be1efa4.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/d5a594d7a66f9ae08e2d10373be1efa4.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Relationships</h2></strong><br>Every townie in Litchi Town has a story to tell, inviting you to intertwine yours with theirs. From small talk to deep, meaningful bonds, the town's social fabric is rich with potential. With a cast of charming characters, forge relationships that might blossom into romance, familial ties, or lifelong friendships.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/f4457bb598f9986591b6601931186f99.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/f4457bb598f9986591b6601931186f99.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/f4457bb598f9986591b6601931186f99.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cherished Companions</h2></strong><br>Nurture a delightful assortment of farm animals, from clucking chickens to gentle cows, each growing strong under your attentive care, continually offering fresh eggs and milk. The town also harbors friendly strays\u2014feed them, and they'll follow you home, weaving their way into the fabric of your daily life. And keep an eye out\u2014Litchi Town occasionally surprises its residents with beloved pandas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/e8b314bad6926525490b46cf3fd0c25c.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/e8b314bad6926525490b46cf3fd0c25c.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/e8b314bad6926525490b46cf3fd0c25c.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gastronomic Quests</h2></strong><br>Ignite your culinary passion in Litchi Town. Start with simple ingredients and a modest stove, where culinary magic awaits. No recipe? No worries! Mix rice with eggs to potentially whip up delicious fried rice or venture into the realm of whimsical creations. Gather ingredients from your harvests, the bustling market, or the rich local waters\u2014home to over forty seasonal fish species\u2014each promising a fresh culinary adventure with every catch.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/1c4f17f239c5fd7facd6c804604a69d9.poster.avif?t=1745485784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/1c4f17f239c5fd7facd6c804604a69d9.webm?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349630/extras/1c4f17f239c5fd7facd6c804604a69d9.mp4?t=1745485784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
